1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,918
Hi everyone, I'm Lei Jie!

2
00:00:02,968 --> 00:00:07,140
Welcome to the Ink Spirits Mini Lesson.

3
00:00:07,190 --> 00:00:15,765
Today: HSK 2, Lesson 1 — September is the best time to visit Beijing.

4
00:00:15,815 --> 00:00:22,100
In this episode, Xiao Yan found the character 睛, as in 眼睛 (eye).

5
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:27,263
First, new words. Listen, then repeat after me.

6
00:01:06,942 --> 00:01:11,586
The most important character today is 睛, as in 眼睛 (eye).

7
00:01:11,636 --> 00:01:14,791
On the left is 目 — an eye.

8
00:01:14,841 --> 00:01:18,415
Long, long ago, people drew an eye lying sideways.

9
00:01:18,465 --> 00:01:22,981
Later, the eye stood up and became today's 目.

10
00:01:23,031 --> 00:01:26,680
On the right is 青, as in 青墨镇 (Qingmo Town).

11
00:01:26,730 --> 00:01:31,326
青 gives the sound: qīng, jīng. Sound alike, right?

12
00:01:31,376 --> 00:01:35,849
Characters with 目 are all about eyes: 眼, 睛, 看.

13
00:01:35,899 --> 00:01:40,680
画龙点睛: paint the eyes on a dragon — the finishing touch.

14
00:01:42,532 --> 00:01:43,994
Three more characters.

15
00:01:44,044 --> 00:01:45,740
First: 它.

16
00:01:45,790 --> 00:01:48,721
它 was first drawn as a snake.

17
00:01:48,771 --> 00:01:55,835
People long ago feared snakes. They'd greet each other: "No snakes today?"

18
00:01:55,885 --> 00:01:59,453
Later, 它 came to mean "it" — for animals and things.

19
00:01:59,503 --> 00:02:02,528
Its name is Huahua.

20
00:02:02,578 --> 00:02:04,430
Second: 足.

21
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:07,307
On top is the knee; below is the foot.

22
00:02:07,357 --> 00:02:14,213
Characters with 足 use your feet: 踢 kick, 跑 run, 跳 jump.

23
00:02:14,263 --> 00:02:16,605
Play football!

24
00:02:16,655 --> 00:02:18,351
Third: 最.

25
00:02:18,401 --> 00:02:22,244
Below is 取: a hand grabbing an ear.

26
00:02:22,294 --> 00:02:26,033
Grab first, take the most — that's 最, "the most".

27
00:02:26,083 --> 00:02:30,516
最好 the best · 最喜欢 like the most.

28
00:02:32,358 --> 00:02:33,915
Two sentence patterns.

29
00:02:33,965 --> 00:02:39,284
One: When is the best time to go?

30
00:02:39,334 --> 00:02:45,284
September is the best time to visit Beijing.

31
00:02:45,334 --> 00:02:49,722
Two: 不 A 也不 B — neither A nor B.

32
00:02:49,772 --> 00:02:54,830
Beijing in September is neither cold nor hot.

33
00:02:54,880 --> 00:03:02,136
Your turn: Which month is best to visit your country? Why?

34
00:03:02,436 --> 00:03:04,158
Quiz time! Ready?

35
00:03:04,208 --> 00:03:15,998
Q1: Which character has the 目 (eye) radical?

36
00:03:16,366 --> 00:03:19,590
The answer is B: 睛.

37
00:03:20,357 --> 00:03:32,863
Q2: What animal was 它 first drawn as?

38
00:03:33,231 --> 00:03:37,402
The answer is C: a snake.

39
00:03:38,170 --> 00:03:49,095
Q3: Fill in the blank: I ___ like playing football.

40
00:03:49,463 --> 00:03:56,634
The answer is A: I like playing football the most.

41
00:03:57,334 --> 00:04:02,418
What's your favorite sport? Why?

42
00:04:02,468 --> 00:04:05,709
Go and tell Xiao Yan!

43
00:04:05,759 --> 00:04:09,434
See you next lesson. Bye!
